        "title": "Fix background process visual bug in dev-process-manager",
        "summary": "Corrects result access in `npm-app/src/dev-process-manager.ts` from `result` to `result[0].value` before checking `processId`. This resolves a visual bug where successful background process starts were incorrectly flagged as failures in the console output.",
